From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: text size choice on the Theme step

Small, Medium, Large or Larger text (font scale 0.9, 1.0, 1.15, 1.3) under
the accent on the Theme step, written to Settings.System.FONT_SCALE. Larger is
the biggest size Sable lays out and tests on the Q25's 411 dp square screen;
Android's Font size slider stays in Settings for bigger text, and a scale set
there shows as custom. Settings > Display > Text size offers the same four.
Pure values in sable/SableTextSize.
